              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "شومینه (shumine) — \"a fireplace\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "شبهای زمستان کنار شومینه مینشینیم. shabhâ-ye zemestân kenâr-e shumine mineshinim. On winter nights we sit by the fireplace."
